# 45. Role Dashboards: Facility & Support Operations

Roles: `housekeeping_supervisor`, `facility_manager` (`maintenance`), `biomedical_engineer`, `security`, `ambulance`, `mortuary_attendant`, `diet_kitchen_admin` (`dietician_head`, `kitchen_staff`), `ward_boy`.
**Family rule:** task cards with scan proof (WorkTask), SLA timers, mobile-first/offline, no patient clinical data; `ward_boy`/`maintenance` ke liye spec abhi nahi/aliased.

### Housekeeping Supervisor (`housekeeping_supervisor`)
- **Purpose:** Room/bed cleaning turnaround, terminal cleaning, laundry.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `/dashboards/housekeeping_supervisor` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 1 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions / 1 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** Beds awaiting cleaning + avg turnaround; Tasks completed vs SLA; Terminal cleans (OT/isolation); Audit scores; Staff on shift
- **Worklists / queues:** Cleaning queue (priority by bed demand); Isolation/terminal cleans; Complaints
- **Alerts:** Cleaning >30 min; Missed checklist; Isolation clean pending
- **Quick actions:** Assign staff, Mark ready, Start audit
- **Sections / tabs:** Queue · Isolation · Audits · Linen
- **Features:** Auto task from discharge (bed → Cleaning); Checklist with photo/scan proof; Linen issue/return count; SLA timers
- **Data / APIs:** `/housekeeping/*`, `/work-tasks`, bed board, `/linen`
- **Permissions & privacy:** No patient info.

### Facility / Engineering Manager (+ maintenance) (`facility_manager`)
- **Purpose:** Utilities, equipment tickets, NOC/licences.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `/dashboards/facility_manager` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 1 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions / 1 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** Open tickets & SLA breach; Uptime (DG/UPS/HVAC/lifts/oxygen plant); PM compliance %; Energy use; Licences/NOC expiring
- **Worklists / queues:** Maintenance tickets; PM calendar; Vendor AMC visits; Medical-gas log
- **Alerts:** Oxygen/medical gas low; DG fuel low; NOC <60d; Ticket SLA breach
- **Quick actions:** Create ticket, Assign engineer, Log meter, Open AMC
- **Sections / tabs:** Tickets · Assets · Utilities · Licences · Vendors
- **Features:** Asset register with AMC/warranty/PM; Utility meters & logs; Fire/lift/pollution/AERB NOC tracker (`License`); Ticket SLA & escalation
- **Data / APIs:** `/biomedical/*`, `/contracts`, `/licenses`, `/work-tasks`
- **Permissions & privacy:** Asset data only.

